# The team's TEST traveler account, for the real-write tests
# (e2e/real-writes/, run with `npm run test:writes`).
#
# 1. On the website, choose Log in -> Create account and make a NEW account
#    used only for testing (for example yourteam+test@gmail.com). Never use
#    anyone's personal account, and never an admin account.
# 2. Copy this file to .env.test.local (git never saves .env files) and
#    fill in that account below.
# 3. Start the dev servers, then run `npm run test:writes`.
#
# Without these two values, the real-write tests are skipped.
E2E_TEST_EMAIL=
E2E_TEST_PASSWORD=

# Optional: which place the test reviews. Pick one the test account has
# not reviewed yet. Default: Breakthrough Restaurant.
E2E_TEST_PLACE=/destinations/5d1155a1-6e40-417d-9c84-09a990cae00d
